WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.460
Welcome to NjordDeploy. Let's start an automated discovery scan to locate nodes on our network.

00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:25.379
Target node njord-cloud-01 discovered at 192.168.1.185. Entering SSH credentials for hardware verification.

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:40.130
Target verified: 8 gigabytes of RAM and 64 gigabytes of storage. Zero target dependencies required.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:59.479
In the Turnkey Stacks catalog, selecting The Modern Sovereign Workplace. With one click, Nextcloud, MariaDB, Redis cache, push notifications, and Vaultwarden are instantly coordinated.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:17.130
Deployment complete! All enterprise microservices are provisioned, isolated, and verified healthy.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:24.280
Launch Nextcloud and Vaultwarden web dashboards instantly from your private sovereign cloud harbor.
